	(gr_text "Seen from the front; the F side faces the back of the panel. Outline = the panel outline.\nCut-outs clear the instrument bodies and display modules by 1 mm: 92 mm squares for the 80 mm RB\ncases, 79 x 85 mm for the 57 mm shells with the GPS hood, display bezel + 2 mm.\nHoles on the panel screws (M4) and the display screws (M3): stand the board off the panel on them.\nSwitches, keys, push-pulls and knobs are drawn on Dwgs.User at their panel cut-outs: place PCB-mount\nparts there, or add cut-outs for panel-mount parts.\nPCB fabs limit the board size (often 500 mm or less): split the board along the print tile seams."
		(at 114.5 363 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "e2baeaef-ee7e-4e07-980c-4bdc463605c0")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.192)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
